This is a CBP ruling on a collapsible fabric storage chest. Candidate classifications are 6307.90.98 (other made up articles) and 4202.92 (storage cases with outer surface of textile), but toy chests are not fitted containers like trunks. Similar rulings on collapsible fabric storage bins and cubes have gone to 6307.90.9889 (other made up articles, of textile materials). For nonwoven textile storage boxes, the usual answer is 6307.90.9889.

An alternative is 3924 or 9403, but the nonwoven fabric construction points to 6307. The fabric is a nonwoven, and chapter 63 covers made up articles of any textile fabric. Chapter 42 covers trunks, but the sewn nonwoven with a cardboard insert is a storage item, not a luggage-type trunk. CBP has classified similar items, such as collapsible storage bins of nonwoven polypropylene, in 6307.90.9889.

{"hts_code": "6307.90.9889", "reason": "The collapsible storage chest is made of nonwoven polypropylene textile fabric, is a household storage item rather than luggage, and falls under other made up textile articles."}
